      "Q": {
        "slot": "Q",
        "id": "FiddleSticksQ",
        "name": "Terrify",
        "summary": "Fiddlesticks damaging enemies with spells while unseen or targeting an enemy with Terrify's activation strikes a target unit with fear, causing it to flee in terror for a duration.",
        "bodyHtml": "<span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 italic\">Passive:</span> While unseen and out of combat or impersonating an <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Effigy</span>, damaging an enemy with an ability <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Fears</span> them for 1.2/1.4/1.6/1.8/2 second(s).<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-semibold\">Active:</span> <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Fear</span> an enemy for 1.2/1.4/1.6/1.8/2 second(s) and deal <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(4/4.5/5/5.5/6% + (0.03% Ability Power)) current Health magic damage</span>. If the target has recently been <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Feared</span> by Fiddlesticks, instead deal <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(8/9/10/11/12% + (0.06% Ability Power)) current Health magic damage</span>.<br /><br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Deals a minimum of <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">40/60/80/100/120 magic damage</span>, or <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">80/120/160/200/240 magic damage</span> if the target has been recently <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Feared</span> by Fiddlesticks.</span><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Deals a maximum of <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">400 magic damage</span> to minions and jungle monsters.</span>",
