      "W": {
        "slot": "W",
        "id": "FiddleSticksW",
        "name": "Bountiful Harvest",
        "summary": "Fiddlesticks drains health from nearby enemies, dealing bonus execute damage at the end of the duration.",
        "bodyHtml": "Fiddlesticks channels and drains the souls of nearby enemies, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(60/90/120/150/180 + (45% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> per second for 2 seconds, plus <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">12/14.5/17/19.5/22% missing Health magic damage</span> at the end. Fiddlesticks restores <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">25/32.5/40/47.5/55% of damage as Health</span>.<br /><br />If Fiddlesticks ends the channel without interruption, the remaining Cooldown is reduced by 60%.<br /><br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Healing based on pre-mitigation damage.<br />Against monsters, this Ability deals 135% damage and <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">heals 45%</span> of damage done.<br />Against minions, this Ability deals 50% damage and <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">heals 15%</span> of damage done.</span>",
